{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょんっU。・x・)ノ\n川後です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうございます(。ノωノ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後は、コメントがいつもより前回より多くて嬉しいよーっ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回、全部コメント読んでるよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前記事、初コメさん沢山いて嬉しかったよぅ*。:゜(´っω・*)゜・。+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、よかったらブログ見てくださいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、今日は何してましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事・学校がほとんどかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様です(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜は、学校でしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼ご飯は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めろんぱん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコチップ入りなのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったよっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか、一日あっという間だあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えれば、あと数ヶ月でJC卒業なのか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出つくるぞーおっ!!LJC!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたーんhappybirthday!!おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと陽菜は同じ九州出身!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しで、\n上京したてのときは一人が退屈でよく陽菜家やせいたんの家で一緒泊まったりしてたな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前、\nせいたんが陽菜に手紙書いて\n陽菜がせいたんに手紙書いたことがあったのね。\nはい。感動して泣いたよ(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時から、\nぱそこんの待ち受けは変わらずせいたんから貰った手紙の写真です*.+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達想いなせいたんのことが好いちょんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねたんhappybirthday!!おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきおめでとうメールしたあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々ころは初めて見たとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃ！って思ったよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽいなあっても思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃべったら、\nやっぱり尊敬しちゃうくらい大人で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクロバットが出来るのも、チアが出来るのも、スケートが出来るのもカッコイイなあって。すごい特技があるんだなって!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々ころは、本当に可愛いくて、カッコイイ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々ころすきだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさんには何を頼むか質問に答えてくれて\nありがとうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えで多かったのは、乃木坂関連☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか、嬉しいっ(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベ増やして欲しいとか\n直筆当たりたいとかとかっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他には、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲーム機とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生は受験合格とかっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生お互い頑張ろうっ受験合格するように魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの欲しい物把握しました(` ,,・ω・,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲しい物、願いが叶うように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法をかけちゃうぞー?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"kr"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは、何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Xmasまでに考えとこー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が名は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気を操る魔法少女ひなぴょん!!←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空よ大地よ精霊よ私に力をかして！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーした天気になーれっきらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/13/2654681/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。ふざけました。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー楽曲の春のメロディーpv撮影で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲がかかってるから晴れにしようと頑張って魔法かけてたんだ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう。\n個人pvみんな見てくれたかなっ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント見た感じ、だいたいの方がチェックしてくれたみたいでっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーも公式hpで見れるみたいだから\nよかったら見てね♪"},{"type":"break"